# Borland C++ 3.1 — the default compiler for KRONDOR's C code (bc31). A full
# install of the toolchain. Proprietary; NOT committed. Place your own copy here:
#
#     toolchain/bc31/BIN/BCC.EXE    <- the compiler `bak build` invokes
#     toolchain/bc31/INCLUDE/       <- system headers
#     toolchain/bc31/LIB/           <- runtime libraries
#     toolchain/bc31/...            <- the rest of the install (BGI, CLASSLIB, ...)
#
# `bak build` stages these into the FreeDOS/qemu-KVM VM to compile bc31 functions.
# Keep this directory in the repo (via this file), ignore everything in it.
*
!.gitignore
